      "blue": "Single Apache, hot FARP start. Eight AGM-114K and two M261 M151 rocket pods. Escort the friendly truck pair to Protected Destination, clear the BMP checkpoint and hostile resupply vehicles, then defeat the tank reserve. Battle Area entry starts a 30-second reserve delay. Self-lase or use module crew controls; no JTAC, buddy laser, FCR mode or AI crew configuration is authored. Protect truck Protected-1. Control 251 AM. All target and friendly annotations are visible to both coalitions. After all three hostile groups are destroyed, fly through Egress Gate. The initial AI group task points only at Primary Targets; select the other targets manually."
